# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# xmtool monorepo — 根 .gitignore
#
# 原则：仓库只收录「源码 + 文档 + 配置」。构建产物、运行期数据、第三方
# 二进制依赖一律不入库，通过 CI 构建或 GitHub Release 分发。
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- 通用编辑器 / IDE ---------------------------------------------------
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.swp
*~
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# --- 编译产物 ------------------------------------------------------------
bin/
obj/
target/
build/
dist/
*.o
*.obj
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.exp
*.lib
*.class
*.pyc
__pycache__/
*.pyo
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# --- 可执行文件 / 安装包（走 GitHub Release 分发） ----------------------
*.exe
*.dll
*.msi
*.zip
*.7z
*.tar.gz
*.deb
*.rpm
*.apk
*.app
*.dmg

# --- 第三方二进制依赖（vendored，不入库；版本清单见各项目 THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md） ---
libs/
analyzers/
*.snk

# --- 运行期数据 / 日志 / 备份（含用户凭据，绝不入库） --------------------
data/
logs/
backup/
run/
releases/
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.bak
*.log
data.js
data.bak.js
*.import-failed
!*/docs/_evidence/**
!*/docs/**/evidence/**

# --- 归档 / 备份目录 ----------------------------------------------------
.migrate_bak/
_archive_*/
_archive/
*.bak_*

# --- 发布与运维内部产物 -------------------------------------------------
.publish/
.deploy/
.snapshots/

# --- 凭据（保险箱：最后一道闸） ------------------------------------------
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets/
credentials/
*.cvault

# --- 临时文件 -----------------------------------------------------------
*.tmp
*.log.*
.tmp/
tmp/
